# .mailmap — canonical author identities for `git log`, `git blame`,
# `git shortlog`, and GitHub's contributors widget.
#
# Format: <Canonical Name> <canonical@email>  <Bad Name> <bad@email>
#
# This file collapses any AI-assistant Co-Authored-By trailer into the
# project maintainer's identity, so the GitHub Contributors widget,
# avatars on the repo home page, and `git shortlog -sn` show one
# canonical author. The trailer text itself stays in the commit message
# bodies for transparency about how the project was built.
Omer Yasir Kucuk <omeryasirkucuk@gmail.com> Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Omer Yasir Kucuk <omeryasirkucuk@gmail.com> Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
